1. Model Features

This model is a trial version and have a set of limited features
compared with the standard full functional models provided by ARM.

The limited features of this model are:

- No programmers model and debug registers trace.
- No ARM instruction disassembler or instruction trace.
- Simulation limit to 5 million MCLK cycles


2. Control of JTAG ID

Default JTAG ID is  0x3f0f0f0f 

To change the default value, you can either use ENV variable or 
HDL parameter.  If both are used, the ENV variable takes the priority.

* Use ENV variable ARM_DEVICEID

  setenv ARM_DEVICEID  "desired value"
  
  Here the value should be in integer format.

* Use HDL parameter

  When the ARM7TDMI model is instantiated add the following :


	defparam theARM7TDMI.JTAG_ID = x;               <-----
 	ARM7TDMI theARM7TDMI (....

  Here x is the desired value in integer format.



